Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Magna Carta, that's the power that can cause earthquakes or make it rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.00,0:00:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But you need a bunch of sacred treasures to make it work, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.00,0:00:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, the more of the sacred treasures you possess, the more power you can call forth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.00,0:00:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,If we could use the Magna Carta, then we could get revenge on the Yossil.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.00,0:00:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You will never be able to use the Magna Carta if you think like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.00,0:00:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.00,0:00:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The Magna Carta is unbelievably powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.00,0:00:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless you have the necessary training, you won't be able to use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.00,0:00:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll become stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.00,0:00:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, Mano, the Magna Carta can be evoked regardless of one's strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.00,0:01:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But first, you must understand how this world works.
